#: eed40d535e84461fb8a9d5502d7e7b57
msgid ""
"The JAE (Japan Aviation Electronics Industry) JFB-110 autopilot is made in "
"Japan with a focus on robustness and reliability.  Instead of the more "
"common JST connectors, this autopilot uses automotive grade water proof "
"connectors for most peripherals.  It also includes an automotive grade IMU "
"and high speed TypeC USB."
msgstr ""
"JAE（日本航空电子工业）JFB-110 飞控在日本制造，注重稳健性和可靠性。与更常见的 JST "
"接口不同，该飞控的大多数外设使用汽车级防水接口，同时还配备汽车级 IMU 和高速 TypeC USB。"

