#: ../../source/docs/common-jae-jfb110.rst:310
#: 499379d306c9413b8bd9604bf1c248df 6958602a52c44f06853b58cbc2d28e5e
#: 87d0056fd25a486a8528aa957ca0e680 87eeb4386f49422c984d6fa22f59dcd5
#: 9c886c7a806d42abad35bf446d33f116 b4c25db8a31349dfabeb5ebf1f94146e
msgid ""
"The RC In pin, is mapped to a timer input  and can be used for all ArduPilot"
" supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS, FPort, and SRXL2 which "
"require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, can provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"RC In 引脚映射到定时器输入，支持所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS、FPort 和 SRXL2 "
"除外（这些协议需要真实 UART 连接）。不过，FPort 以此方式连接时可提供 RC 功能（无数传）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jae-jfb110.rst:312
#: 41a244ab75384bc1aa1a322ccdadd71e 93f15fa036ad400a9f36f123c493ab02
#: a89146c9839149949d3e4c99a879e769 bb9dce9c7fb644ceb98f4516a2484587
#: d8c6b2620cdb4c27aeaeef21c3d5a93b f80f927ce1e2409596d526d39e950a0f
msgid ""
"An alternate RC input is setup on SERIAL5 RX input and provides the same "
"capabilities as above except it does not support PPM."
msgstr "SERIAL5 RX 输入上设有备用 RC 输入，除不支持 PPM 外，功能与上述相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jae-jfb110.rst:314
#: 00285371ed36464ab28c1a85f9d21796 31be1eaa048941b6ad0dced1ee731881
#: c34a50a05412424ba38303b5f51ab05c f02f58db62cd4588af07111c5b8f7189
#: f11b85de84014e89b3c5ae96d6ad3f99 fbce96d948ce4fbf9ef41618451bdb6d
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in FPort, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, any full UART with DMA can be assigned to be used as the RC "
"connection instead of the PPM pin. For example SERIAL4 could be re-assigned "
"as RC input."
msgstr ""
"为使用 FPort、CRSF、SRXL2 接收机中的 CRSF 和内嵌数传功能，可将任意带 DMA 的完整 UART 指定用于 RC 连接，而不使用 "
"PPM 引脚。例如可将 SERIAL4 重新分配为 RC 输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jae-jfb110.rst:316
#: 817760792ab04d2fb67a87ccf9b86df9
msgid ""
"With this option, :ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` must be set to "
"\"23\", :ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` must be cahnged to some "
"other protocol than its default of \"23\" (only one UART is allowed to have "
"that protocol in a system), and:"
msgstr ""
"使用此选项时，:ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` "
"必须设置为「23」，:ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` "
"必须更改为其默认值「23」以外的其他协议（系统中只允许一个 UART 使用该协议），并且："

#: ../../source/docs/common-jae-jfb110.rst:318
